text: "---\nmodule: \"05-POST-DELIVERY\"\npart: \"C\"\ntitle: \"Upsell & Cross-Sell\"\nversion: \"2026.05\"\nstatus: \"Production-Ready\"\n---\n\n# 05C: Upsell & Cross-Sell\n\n> **Core Principle:** Your existing clients are 5x more likely to buy from you than new prospects. Upselling isn't pushy — it's helping clients get more value from the relationship they've already invested in.\n>\n> *\"Other services you can sell: SEO, Maintenance and security of website, ADS, Copywriting, Social media management, Content research, Basic Graphic design, Basic video/reels editing.\"* — Him Singh\n\n---\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n1. [The Revenue Expansion Framework](#1-the-revenue-expansion-framework)\n2. [Upsell Timing & Triggers](#2-upsell-timing--triggers)\n3. [Cross-Sell Matrix](#3-cross-sell-matrix)\n4. [The Upsell Conversation](#4-the-upsell-conversation)\n5. [Productized Services](#5-productized-services)\n6. [AI Prompts](#6-ai-prompts)\n7. [Action Checklist](#7-action-checklist)\n\n---\n\n## 1. The Revenue Expansion Framework\n\n### The 4 Types of Revenue Expansion\n\n| Type | Definition | Example | Difficulty |\n|------|------------|---------|------------|\n| **Upsell** | More of the same service | Bigger model, more features, higher tier | Easy |\n| **Cross-Sell** | Different but related service | SEO after web dev, ads after copywriting | Medium |\n| **Deepen** | More strategic involvement | From execution to advisory | Medium |\n| **Expand** | Same service, new department/team | Roll out to other teams | Hard |\n\n### The Math\n\n| Metric | Value |\n|--------|-------|\n| **Cost to acquire new client** | $500-$2,000 |\n| **Cost to upsell existing client** | $50-$200 |\n| **Probability of upsell success** | 60-70% |\n| **Probability of new client close** | 10-20% |\n| **Average upsell value** | 30-50% of original project |\n\n**Conclusion:** Upselling is 10x more efficient than new client acquisition.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Upsell Timing & Triggers\n\n### The Upsell Timeline\n\n| Timing | Trigger | Opportunity | Approach |\n|--------|---------|-------------|----------|\n| **At delivery** | Project complete | \"While we're at it...\" | Add adjacent feature |\n| **At 30 days** | System stable | \"Now that this is working...\" | Enhance/optimize |\n| **At 90 days** | Results visible | \"Based on the data...\" | Expand capabilities |\n| **Quarterly** | Business review | \"For next quarter...\" | Strategic addition |\n| **Annually** | Contract renewal | \"As we renew...\" | Upgrade tier |\n| **Event-driven** | Funding, launch, expansion | \"Congrats on [event]...\" | Scale support |\n\n### Event-Driven Triggers\n\n| Client Event | Your Upsell | Script Opening |\n|--------------|-------------|----------------|\n| **Raised funding** | Scale infrastructure | \"Congrats on the raise! With growth comes...\" |\n| **Hired new team** | Training + documentation | \"Saw you hired [role]. I can help onboard them...\" |\n| **Launched new product** | New model/pipeline | \"Exciting launch! Have you thought about...\" |\n| **Expanded to new market** | Localization + adaptation | \"New market = new data patterns. I can help...\" |\n| **Competitor launched AI** | Competitive feature | \"Saw [competitor] launched X. Want to stay ahead?\" |\n| **Negative review** | Fix + improvement | \"Saw the review about [issue]. I can help...\" |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Cross-Sell Matrix\n\n### For AI/ML Freelancers\n\n| If Client Bought... | Cross-Sell... | Why It Fits | Your Price |\n|---------------------|---------------|-------------|------------|\n| **Churn prediction model** | LTV prediction + pricing optimization | Same data, new use case | $3,000-$5,000 |\n| **Demand forecasting** | Inventory optimization + supplier automation | Natural extension | $4,000-$7,000 |\n| **OCR/text extraction** | Document classification + workflow automation | Same tech stack | $2,500-$4,000 |\n| **API development** | Frontend dashboard + admin panel | Full-stack value | $3,000-$6,000 |\n| **Model deployment** | Monitoring + drift detection + retraining | Ongoing reliability | $1,500-$3,000/mo |\n| **Data pipeline** | Data warehouse + BI dashboards | Analytics layer | $3,000-$5,000 |\n| **NLP chatbot** | Sentiment analysis + ticket routing | Same domain | $2,000-$4,000 |\n| **Computer vision** | Quality control + defect detection | Industrial application | $5,000-$10,000 |\n\n### For Full-Stack Developers\n\n| If Client Bought... | Cross-Sell... | Why It Fits | Your Price |\n|---------------------|---------------|-------------|------------|\n| **Website** | SEO + content strategy | Traffic + conversions | $1,500-$3,000/mo |\n| **Web app** | Mobile app (React Native) | Cross-platform | $5,000-$10,000 |\n| **E-commerce** | Email automation + abandoned cart | Revenue recovery | $1,000-$2,000 |\n| **SaaS MVP** | Analytics + user onboarding | Growth tools | $2,000-$4,000 |\n| **API** | Documentation + developer portal | API adoption | $1,500-$3,000 |\n\n### For Data Scientists\n\n| If Client Bought... | Cross-Sell... | Why It Fits | Your Price |\n|---------------------|---------------|-------------|------------|\n| **Reporting dashboard** | Automated alerts + anomaly detection | Proactive insights | $1,500-$3,000 |\n| **A/B testing** | Experimentation platform + statistical consulting | Scientific growth | $2,000-$4,000 |\n| **Customer segmentation** | Personalized recommendation engine | Revenue lift | $4,000-$8,000 |\n| **Fraud detection** | Risk scoring + compliance reporting | Regulatory needs | $3,000-$6,000 |\n\n---\n\n## 4. The Upsell Conversation\n\n### The Natural Upsell Framework\n\n```\n1. ACKNOWLEDGE current success\n   \"The churn model is predicting with 89% accuracy...\"\n\n2. IDENTIFY adjacent opportunity\n   \"...and I noticed your LTV data is clean enough to add \n    a customer segmentation model\"\n\n3. QUANTIFY the added value\n   \"This would let you personalize onboarding, which typically \n    improves activation by 15-20%\"\n\n4. MAKE IT EASY\n   \"Since the data pipeline is already built, this would only \n    take 2 weeks and $3,000\"\n\n5. ASK FOR THE NEXT STEP\n   \"Worth exploring in our next check-in?\"\n```\n\n### The \"While We're At It\" Upsell (At Delivery)\n\n```\n\"As we're wrapping up [project], I noticed something that could \nadd significant value with minimal extra work.\n\nSince I've already built [infrastructure/pipeline], adding \n[feature] would only take [X] hours but give you [Y benefit].\n\nIt would mean [specific outcome], and since I'm already deep \nin the codebase, I can do it for $[Amount] instead of the \nusual $[Higher Amount].\n\nInterested? If not, no worries — just thought I'd mention it \nwhile I'm here.\"\n```\n\n### The Data-Driven Upsell (At 30-90 Days)\n\n```\n\"I've been reviewing [system] performance over the last [period], \nand the data shows something interesting:\n\n[Metric 1] is performing at [X]%, but [Metric 2] has room for \nimprovement. \n\nIf we added [enhancement], I estimate we could improve \n[Metric 2] by [Y]%, which translates to approximately \n$[Value] in [revenue/savings].\n\nThe investment would be $[Amount] and [timeline]. \nWorth discussing?\"\n```\n\n### The Strategic Upsell (Quarterly)\n\n```\n\"As we plan for [next quarter], I wanted to share an observation:\n\n[Client's competitors/industry] are increasingly investing in \n[capability]. Based on your roadmap, this aligns with your \ngoal of [objective].\n\nI can help you get ahead by [specific approach]. This would \nposition you as [competitive advantage].\n\nShall we include this in the Q[Number] plan?\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## 5. Productized Services\n\n### What is Productization?\n\nTurning custom work into repeatable, packaged services:\n\n| Custom Work | Productized Version | Price |\n|-----------|---------------------|-------|\n| \"I'll build you a churn model\" | \"Churn Prediction in a Box\" — 2-week delivery, fixed scope | $5,000 |\n| \"I'll audit your AI system\" | \"AI Health Check\" — 1-week assessment, standard report | $1,500 |\n| \"I'll train your team\" | \"MLOps Bootcamp\" — 2-day workshop, standard curriculum | $3,000 |\n| \"I'll optimize your pipeline\" | \"Pipeline Performance Tune-Up\" — 3-day optimization | $2,500 |\n\n### Benefits of Productization\n\n| Benefit | Impact |\n|---------|--------|\n| **Predictable pricing** | Clients know exactly what they get |\n| **Faster sales** | No custom scoping for every project |\n| **Higher margins** | Repeatable = efficient |\n| **Easier marketing** | Clear value proposition |\n| **Scalable** | Can train others to deliver |\n\n### Productized Service Template\n\n```markdown\n# [Service Name]\n\n## The Problem\n[Target client] is struggling with [specific pain], which costs \nthem approximately [quantified cost] per [time period].\n\n## The Solution\nIn [timeframe], I will [specific deliverable] that [specific outcome].\n\n## What's Included\n• [Deliverable 1]\n• [Deliverable 2]\n• [Deliverable 3]\n• [Deliverable 4]\n\n## What's NOT Included\n• [Excluded 1]\n• [Excluded 2]\n\n## The Investment\n**$[Amount]** — Fixed price, delivered in [timeframe]\n\n## The Guarantee\nIf [specific condition], I will [remedy].\n\n## Next Step\nBook a 15-min call to see if this is right for you: [Calendly link]\n```\n\n---\n\n## 6. AI Prompts\n\n### Prompt 1: Upsell Opportunity Finder\n\n```\nAct as a growth strategist for freelance services.\n\nCurrent client project:\n- What we built: [DESCRIPTION]\n- Client's business: [TYPE]\n- Their current metrics: [NUMBERS]\n- Their stated goals: [OBJECTIVES]\n- Their tech stack: [TOOLS]\n\nIdentify 3 natural upsell opportunities:\n1. Immediate (can add to current project)\n2. Near-term (30-60 days post-launch)\n3. Strategic (next quarter)\n\nFor each:\n- The opportunity\n- Why it fits their goals\n- Estimated value to them\n- Your price\n- How to introduce it (script opening)\n```\n\n### Prompt 2: Cross-Sell Matrix Builder\n\n```\nAct as a service expansion strategist.\n\nMy core services:\n1. [Service A]\n2. [Service B]\n3. [Service C]\n\nBuild a cross-sell matrix:\n\nFor each core service, identify:\n1. 3 complementary services\n2. Why they fit (logical connection)\n3. Typical upsell price\n4. Best timing to introduce\n5. Script opening line\n\nFormat as a table I can reference during client conversations.\n```\n\n### Prompt 3: Productized Service Designer\n\n```\nAct as a product strategist for freelance services.\n\nMy most common custom project:\n- Description: [WHAT YOU BUILD]\n- Typical timeline: [WEEKS]\n- Typical price: $[AMOUNT]\n- Common variations: [LIST]\n\nTurn this into a productized service:\n1. Service name (catchy but clear)\n2. Fixed price\n3. Fixed timeline\n4. Standard deliverables (5-7 items)\n5. Standard exclusions (3-5 items)\n6. Guarantee or risk reversal\n7. Sales page copy (300 words)\n\nMake it feel premium and turnkey.\n```\n\n---\n\n## 7. Action Checklist\n\n### For Every Active Client\n\n- [ ] Map their current services to upsell opportunities\n- [ ] Identify 3 cross-sell services that fit\n- [ ] Set calendar reminders (30-day, 90-day, quarterly)\n- [ ] Prepare data-driven upsell pitch\n- [ ] Practice upsell conversation with peer\n\n### Monthly\n\n- [ ] Review client list for upsell opportunities\n- [ ] Send 1 upsell pitch to qualified client\n- [ ] Track upsell success rate\n- [ ] Refine pitches based on response\n\n### Quarterly\n\n- [ ] Review productized service offerings\n- [ ] Add new productized service based on demand\n- [ ] Update pricing based on value delivered\n- [ ] Train yourself on new cross-sell services\n\n---\n\n> **Next:** [05D: Offboarding →](05D-OFFBOARDING.md)\n>\n> *\"The best upsell doesn't feel like a sale. It feels like a natural next step.\"*\n\n---\n\n*Module 05C | Upsell & Cross-Sell | Version 2026.05*\n"
